### Export Compliance - ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption

**EVERY app MUST include this key in Info.plist:**

```xml
<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
<false/>
```

This tells Apple your app does NOT use encryption algorithms that require export compliance documentation. Set to `false` for apps that:
- Don't use custom encryption
- Only use HTTPS (standard iOS networking)
- Only use Apple's built-in encryption APIs

**Add via PlistBuddy:**
```bash
/usr/libexec/PlistBuddy -c "Add :ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption bool false" Info.plist
