## TROUBLESHOOTING

### Products Not Loading

1. Check product IDs match exactly
2. Verify products are "Ready to Submit" in App Store Connect
3. Check StoreKit configuration file is set in scheme
4. Try `await subscriptionManager.loadProducts()` manually

### Purchase Fails

1. Check sandbox account is set up
2. Verify signing & capabilities include StoreKit
3. Check console for StoreKit errors

### Pro Status Not Persisting

1. Verify `Transaction.currentEntitlements` is being checked
2. Check for `revocationDate` on transactions
3. Ensure `listenForTransactions()` is running

